@DroneInventory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Create a drone (REQ-001) → 201
POST {{DroneInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/drones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TELLO-07",
  "description": "SSID: TELLO-9FA21B, rechter Propellerschutz beschädigt"
}

### Duplicate name, other case (REQ-001) → 409
POST {{DroneInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/drones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "tello-07"
}

### Empty name (REQ-001) → 422
POST {{DroneInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/drones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

###
